{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000012343","bookName":"Rescatada por el hombre salvaje","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000012343/42000012343.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":683798,"followCount":15204,"introduction":"Mia, una chica de ciudad lastimada por su exnovio, es golpeada y abandonada en una montaña cubierta de nieve. Atrapada entre el hambre y el frío, incluso es atacada por un lobo salvaje. En ese momento, un hombre misterioso la salva. Al principio, ambos chocan y no se soportan, pero con el tiempo comienzan a desarrollar sentimientos el uno por el otro. Mia descubre la verdadera identidad del hombre y enfrenta a su malvado ex. Finalmente, construyen una vida feliz juntos.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Love After Marriage","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Love After Marriage","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Rescatada-por-el-hombre-salvaje","bookNameLower":"rescatada-por-el-hombre-salvaje","shelfTime":"2026-05-16 17:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-16 17:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"12021","performerName":"Cailin Peluso","performerFormatName":"Cailin-Peluso","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x2/12021/12021.jpg?time=1788853262930","videoCount":10},{"performerId":"12301","performerName":"Tyler Harlow","performerFormatName":"Tyler-Harlow","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x0/12301/12301.jpg?time=1782882562491","videoCount":3},{"performerId":"29255","performerName":"Ashlynn Judy","performerFormatName":"Ashlynn-Judy","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x5/29255/29255.jpg?time=1783593304158","videoCount":5}],"performerIdList":[12021,12301,29255]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700787590","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dram